# Local-only large assets: ignore contents, keep README so the dir shows on GitHub
home/wallpapers/*
!home/wallpapers/README.md
overlays/local-apps/*
!overlays/local-apps/README.md

# Agent/audit artifacts: keep them out of `git status` so the tracked diff stays
# reviewable. They still exist on disk; to version them use `git add -f audit/...`.
.agent-teams/
audit/
.omo